== Walkthrough ==

Inside Fish's Ale:

: McNeal Jocub says 'Blast!! We are running [low]!!'

Your Location is -243.82, -261.48, 3.28

You say, 'Hail, McNeal Jocub'

: McNeal Jocub says 'Good ta see ya! Now start showin' these poodlewalkers how a real fish drinks!'

You say, 'Running low on what?'

: McNeal Jocub says 'This is going to sound crazy, but my main supplier of [Blackburrow Stout] is one of the brewers themselves. I have run too low on the fine brew and need someone to [pick up my shipment].'

You say, 'I will pick up the shipment.'

: McNeal Jocub says 'Take this note to the Qeynos Hills. Somewhere there, you shall find a gnoll at night called Gnasher. Give him the note. Now, get moving!'

You receive "A tattered note" (identifies as "To Branick").  It reads:

 Branick Notai Here is the lackey I sent to retrieve this month's shipment. I have informed The Circle of your needs and they will provide you with them at a later date. McJ

Gnasher Furgutt sometimes wanders around the Qeynos Hills (/loc?).

You say, 'Hail, Gnasher Furgutt'

: [[Gnasher Furgutt]] says 'Who are you? Did McNeal send you? If not, you would do yourself good to leave Gnasher alone. I have friends in high places.'

'''Give Gnasher the note.'''

: Gnasher Furgutt says 'Ah. Good for you! Here you are. Take this to McNeal, but next time there will be no stout if there are no weapons.'
